Lent jellyfin-mw (port 8097) to everyone in your groups, up to 8 people at once.
jellyfin-mw asks each person to sign in once, with an account you make them. In jellyfin: your picture at the top right, then Dashboard, Users and +; give it a name and a password, tick the libraries they may watch, and Save. Then tell each person theirs.
svrngs is running here already, so they can open it now.
`svrngs unshare jellyfin-mw` stops lending it.
